    <main id="guide">
      <header class="hero" id="overview">
        <div class="hero-top"><p class="eyebrow">Design, UX, UI &amp; product logic</p><span class="folio">A guide for a thinking agent</span></div>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1><span lang="ja">手応え</span><br><em>in every action.</em></h1>
            <p class="hero-intro">Give every action the right resistance and a satisfying response, in service of what the person came to do. Let that care sustain engagement through ordinary moments as well as decisive ones.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="purpose-figure">
            <p class="figure-top">Purpose sets the direction</p>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 380 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="purpose-title purpose-desc">
              <title id="purpose-title">手応え connects every part of the experience</title>
              <desc id="purpose-desc">Visuals, motion and music, workflow, and decisions share 手応え as their implementation anchor: resistance and response scaled to each moment, directed by the project's purpose.</desc>
              <g fill="none" stroke="#7b9780" stroke-width="1">
